## High-Converting 40-Second Script: Daily Greens & Gut Health

```text
[0:00 - 0:04] THE HOOK (Visual: Creator yawning at office desk, staring at 3 empty espresso cups)
Voiceover: "I used to drink three iced Americanos every day just to survive 2 PM, and all it gave me was jitters and terrible bloating."

[0:04 - 0:14] THE HABIT LOOP (Visual: Aesthetic kitchen counter. Pouring cold water into glass, adding scoop of vibrant green powder, quick frother spin)
Voiceover: "Three weeks ago I completely swapped my afternoon caffeine crash for this 30-second daily gut health ritual. And honestly? I was terrified it would taste like grass clippings."

[0:14 - 0:24] THE TASTE & SENSORY PROOF (Visual: Taking a refreshing sip with genuine smile of surprise)
Voiceover: "It literally tastes like crisp green apple juice. No chalkiness, dissolves instantly, and has zero artificial sweeteners or junk fillers."

[0:24 - 0:32] THE MICRO-SCIENCE (Visual: Macro shots of ingredient badges: 24 Probiotics, Organic Spirulina, Digestive Enzymes)
Voiceover: "It packs 24 clinically studied superfoods and digestive enzymes in one single scoop. My digestion feels completely reset, and my midday focus is rock solid."

[0:32 - 0:40] THE REFRAME & CTA (Visual: Unboxing bundle with free glass bottle and 30-day money-back guarantee badge)
Voiceover: "It works out to about a dollar twenty a day. They have a 30-day risk-free guarantee, so if you don't feel the difference, you get a full refund. Tap the link below to get their starter kit."
```

